Watch Key includes work from the following projects.

kaedenbrinkman/Garmin-TeslaKey - MIT License
https://github.com/kaedenbrinkman/Garmin-TeslaKey
The structure of source/ble/BleTransport.mc follows the BLE delegate from that
project: the GATT profile registration, scan/pair flow and characteristic
notification setup.

teslamotors/vehicle-command - Apache License 2.0
